  "split_decision": "Record each supplied-data and proof-projection seam separately while retaining the complete mixed own-provider schema and all proofs in exact GRWTSK archives. Extracting only selected fields changes the type; adding a legacy self-provider import to expose a consequence would introduce a dependency absent from the original. Do neither.",
