    "The original WittenGenusIndexBoundary H stores supplied TMFContract and WittenGenusWitness values, a supplied CohomologyClass H, independently selected refinesAhat/stringOrientationRequired propositions with proofs, and a source label. Both source theorems genuinely project those supplied proofs.",
