    "The exact inspected TMF context has typed carrier data, a genus function in a separate witness record, and named proposition fields; Hodge filtration context has type-family data and independent propositions. These genuine supplied functions and proof terms are acknowledged, without inferring topological modular forms, filtration degeneration or a comparison theorem from package names.",
    "Retain all three own-provider commands and original imports in exact archives, preserving all hypotheses and historical type identities. Do not weaken the record, add a self-provider dependency, substitute a newer context or create maintained TMF/Witten-genus claims."
